---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="FAQ — Syasya&Realis" page="faq">
<main id="faq">
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow mono"><span>(FAQ) <span data-name>Syasya&Realis</span></span><span>Questions</span></div>
    <h1 class="rv">Questions, <span class="serif">answered.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead rv">Everything clients usually ask before a project. <em class="hl">Still unsure?</em> Send us a message — we reply on WhatsApp or by email.</p>
  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="faq-page rv">
      <div class="qa">
      <details><summary>How much does a project cost?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Every project is quoted after a short brief, based on the deliverables, shoot days and editing time. You get a clear written quote before anything starts.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How long does a project take?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">It depends on the scope. A product video or photo session is quicker than a full company profile. We agree the shoot date, review rounds and final deadline at the brief.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How do I book?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Use the contact form — it opens WhatsApp or email with your brief filled in. We reply and suggest a time for a short brief call.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How many revisions are included?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Revision rounds are written in the quote, so you know in advance what is included.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Do you shoot on location?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Yes. We shoot at your office, factory, store or event. Any travel costs are listed in the quote.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Who owns the final files?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Usage rights for the final videos, photos and designs are set out in the quote. Raw footage can be included on request.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Can you edit footage we already have?<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><div class="ans">Yes — editing, colour grading, sound and motion titles are available as a separate service.</div></details>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="ab-cta">
      <p class="rv">Didn't find <span class="serif">it?</span></p>
      <a class="btn fill" href="/#contact">Ask us directly
        <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 11 11 3M5 3h6v6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
